00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.334 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
- I'm Dave Rubin
and joining me today

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.603 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
is the former United
States Ambassador

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:11.938 line:0%
to the United Nations,

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.307
the former Governor
of South Carolina

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.743
and someone who knows
a little something

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.045
about international relations.

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:21.648 align:start position:0%
Ambassador Nikki Haley, welcome
back to the Rubin Report.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.883 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Thanks so much, it's
great to be with you, Dave.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.285
- Well, I'm glad to
have you this week

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.187
because I've been
telling my audience

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.388
for the last 10 days or so

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.323 align:start size:84% position:16%
that it's extremely
hard right now

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:34.627
to figure out exactly what's
going on in Ukraine and Russia.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.664
And of course, Kamala
Harris did tell us

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:40.100
that Ukraine small, Russia big,

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.202
but I wanna see if we
can give a little more

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:44.971
thoughtful analysis
to that if possible.

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.040
So first, could you just give us

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.542
sort of a Russia-Ukraine 101,

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.177
a little bit of the history,

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.712
some of the geopolitics,

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.080
what got us to this moment

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.648
and then we'll go from there.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.151 line:0%
- Well, I think what
got us to the moment

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.220 line:0%
is we all know that
the Soviet Union fell

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.988 line:0%
and when it fell, you know,

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:04.190 line:0%
Russia apparently had borders

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.626 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
and Ukraine had
freedom and democracy.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:09.529
And what has happened
is Putin has decided

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.231
he's just gonna ignore history.

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:12.999
He's gonna recreate it.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.501
And in his mind,

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.637
he thinks that it needs to
go back to the Soviet Union.

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:21.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so he believes that
Ukraine is part of Russia.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.710
It's part of the Soviet empire

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:27.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he's only taking what
is rightfully theirs.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:32.218
Ukraine on the other hand
is a flourishing democracy

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:34.354
where people appreciate freedom.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:36.322
It was knocking on
Putin's doorstep.

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.691
He was worried that Russians
were gonna see the freedom

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.461 align:start size:84% position:16%
that Ukraine's,
that Ukrainians had.

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.929 align:start size:81% position:19%
And he didn't want
that to happen.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:45.632
The lesson in all of the Dave is

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:49.569
that when an evil dictator thug

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:51.571
says they're gonna do something,

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:52.872
we need to believe them.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:55.041
Putin said he was
gonna take Ukraine

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:56.576
and he is.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:58.878
China said they were gonna
take Hong Kong and they did.

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:02.248 align:start position:0%
Putin says that he's next going
for Poland and the Baltics,

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:03.449
we should believe him.

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:06.252 align:start size:88% position:13%
China says, they're
going to get you Taiwan.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.453
That's gonna happen.

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.689 align:start size:88% position:13%
Iran says, they're gonna
just destroy Israel.

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.624
We need to start
understanding that

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.526
when tyrants say something,

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:15.762 align:start size:88% position:13%
we should believe them,
get in front of it,

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:18.064
so that we don't see this kind
of bloodshed that's happening

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:19.766
because what's happening now is,

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:21.901
is nothing short of a tragedy.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.203
- Is this one of the things

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:25.638
that we discussed in
our original interview,

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.173
say six or eight months ago,

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:29.309
where if we don't,

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:31.211 align:start size:84% position:16%
if the United States
does not lead,

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:32.445
does not say,

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.280
'Hey, we have red lines
that you can't cross'

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.849 align:start size:84% position:16%
say, 'There are things
that you cannot do'

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.318
if we don't do it,

00:03:38.318 --> 00:03:40.920 align:start position:0%
that the world just kind of
goes to hell in the hand basket.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.922 align:start size:97% position:3%
It doesn't mean we do
everything right all the time,

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:45.058
but pretty much without us,

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:46.526
NATO doesn't function,

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:50.029
other countries don't sort
of stand up for what's right?

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:51.664
- Yeah, I think it
was very clear to me

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:52.999
at the United Nations

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:56.703 align:start size:84% position:16%
that whether countries
like the US or not,

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:57.971
they want us to lead.

00:03:57.971 --> 00:04:00.240
They would much rather
follow the United States

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.609 align:start size:97% position:3%
than follow China or
Russia any day of the week.

00:04:02.609 --> 00:04:06.846 align:start position:0%
And you know, what I saw is
when we speak the world listens,

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:08.781
when we act, the world follows,

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:11.184 align:start size:81% position:19%
who we are, the
world wants to be.

00:04:11.184 --> 00:04:14.320
And so it doesn't mean
we have to go to war,

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.956
but it means that we need
to speak and speak loudly

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:19.158
and we need to make sure we
do it in the name of freedom

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:21.027 align:start size:81% position:19%
and we do it in
the name of peace.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:24.797
And what we need to be
saying loudly now is,

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.165
you know, Europeans thought

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:28.167
that if they were
nice to Russia,

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:29.836 line:0%
that Russia would
leave them alone.

00:04:29.836 --> 00:04:32.739 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
And what you find out is when
you sleep with the devil,

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:34.107 line:0%
the devil owns you.

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:37.810 line:0%
Europeans became 40%
dependent on Russia,

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:39.245
on Russian oil.

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:41.514
Russia is a one
industry country.

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:45.318
Their whole livelihoods
is surrounded by energy

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:46.819
and the energy industry

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:51.424
and so what Europe has to do
now is they have to become

00:04:51.424 --> 00:04:53.426
independent of Russian oil,

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:55.461
Poland and Lithuania
have already done that.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:57.664 align:start size:84% position:16%
They're getting
theirs from Australia.

00:04:57.664 --> 00:05:00.266
The United States should
not be taking Russian oil.

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:01.934 align:start size:84% position:16%
We could open up the
Keystone Pipeline

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:04.837
and that would take up the oil
that we're getting from them.

00:05:04.837 --> 00:05:07.573 align:start size:88% position:13%
But also we need to
double down on fracking.

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:10.076 align:start size:84% position:16%
We need to export
liquified natural gas.

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:12.011
We need to really
start to understand

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:14.414 align:start size:81% position:19%
this is a national
security issue

00:05:14.414 --> 00:05:18.318
because while a lot of people
think this is just Ukraine,

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:21.554
a million people have
migrated out of Ukraine

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:23.890
into all of those
European countries,

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.358
especially Poland right now,

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:29.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
the entire European region
is gonna be disrupted.

00:05:29.395 --> 00:05:31.631
And we're all gonna feel that.

00:05:31.631 --> 00:05:35.068
And so this is about being smart

00:05:35.068 --> 00:05:36.536
and realizing where we are,

00:05:36.536 --> 00:05:38.638
and the fact that we need
to be doing something.

00:05:38.638 --> 00:05:40.206 align:start size:84% position:16%
If you see the death
that's happening

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:41.641
in the streets of Ukraine,

00:05:42.709 --> 00:05:44.143
don't think that's over there.

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:46.045
That very well could be us.

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:47.914
That's not saying, you know,

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:50.450
anytime there's
a free democracy,

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.852
there's a tyrant
ready to take it.

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:54.721
We've seen that with
Israel for a long time.

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:56.556
You're now seeing
that with Ukraine,

00:05:56.556 --> 00:05:58.224
you're gonna see it with Taiwan.

00:05:58.224 --> 00:06:01.194 align:start size:97% position:3%
United States has to figure
out what they wanna be

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:02.161
when they lead.

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:04.130
And I think we are always right

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.032
when we lead on the
side of freedom.

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:08.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
- So you briefly
mentioned sanctions there.

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:09.969
I'm sure you saw
the clips last week

00:06:09.969 --> 00:06:11.971 align:start size:84% position:16%
where Jen Psaki
basically was saying,

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:14.173
you know, we have these
incredible sanctions,

00:06:14.173 --> 00:06:16.242
sanctions like you've
never seen before.

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:17.777
And just hours later,

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:20.179
I think it was our Deputy
Energy Secretary who said,

00:06:20.179 --> 00:06:21.581
"Oh, but it won't affect

00:06:21.581 --> 00:06:23.983
the energy sector of
Russia's economy."

00:06:23.983 --> 00:06:25.785 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean, do you sense
that the people

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:26.853
that are in charge right now

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:28.888
from Biden to the spokesmen,

00:06:28.888 --> 00:06:29.822
to the rest of them,

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:31.457
that they have a sense of really

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:32.692
what's going on here?

00:06:32.692 --> 00:06:34.560
- I mean, they're
running scared.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.028
They're running scared.

00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:38.598 align:start size:97% position:3%
Either you're gonna be tough
on Putin or you're not.

00:06:38.598 --> 00:06:40.099
The only way to
be tough on Putin

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:43.236
is to sanction the
energy companies.

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:46.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Zelenskyy of
Ukraine is begging for it.

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:48.307
He's begging for things.

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:49.242
And you know,

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:50.843
are we okay allowing people

00:06:50.843 --> 00:06:52.412
to die in the streets of Ukraine

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:54.514 align:start size:88% position:13%
because we're worried
that Russia will get mad

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:56.616 align:start size:84% position:16%
