their energy sector?

00:06:56.616 --> 00:06:59.385 align:start size:88% position:13%
No, we should be
teaching Russia a lesson

00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:01.721 align:start size:84% position:16%
by sanctioning their
energy companies.

00:07:01.721 --> 00:07:03.089
We should be pulling them out

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:05.158 align:start size:84% position:16%
of the international
banking system.

00:07:05.158 --> 00:07:08.261 align:start size:84% position:16%
We should be sending
arms to Ukraine

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:11.164 align:start size:97% position:3%
so they can defend themselves
and protect themselves.

00:07:11.164 --> 00:07:14.300
You know, they desperately
need anti-air, anti-tank,

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.768
javelin and stinger missiles.

00:07:15.768 --> 00:07:17.670
We should be sending those over.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.639
You know, Zelenskyy has said,

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:21.841
look, you know, send us planes,

00:07:21.841 --> 00:07:24.010
send us tanks, send us anything.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.578
And you know, the United States,

00:07:25.578 --> 00:07:27.413
if we stepped up and did it,

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:29.315 align:start size:88% position:13%
the rest of the world
would step up and do it.

00:07:29.315 --> 00:07:32.151 align:start size:84% position:16%
20 countries now
have provided Ukraine

00:07:32.151 --> 00:07:34.720
with all sorts of
military equipment

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.222
and things that they need

00:07:36.222 --> 00:07:38.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I'm worried it's gonna
be too little too late.

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:39.759
- What would you
say to the people

00:07:39.759 --> 00:07:41.227
who make the argument that,

00:07:41.227 --> 00:07:43.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
okay, so you do everything
you can on sanctions.

00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:46.399
We arm the Ukrainians, we
get some real alliance,

00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:48.768 align:start size:81% position:19%
