against Putin,

00:07:48.768 --> 00:07:51.137
but this guy does have nukes.

00:07:51.137 --> 00:07:52.405
There's questions about,

00:07:52.405 --> 00:07:54.040
you know, what his
real motives are

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.675
and mental health and
all of that stuff.

00:07:55.675 --> 00:07:58.010
That, if we do

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.312 align:start size:84% position:16%
basically what you're
laying out there,

00:07:59.312 --> 00:08:00.780
that we then,

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.048
we just don't know what's
at the end of the road

00:08:02.048 --> 00:08:03.416
or that if you pin this guy,

00:08:03.416 --> 00:08:05.284
or if you pinned
him into a corner.

00:08:05.284 --> 00:08:07.119
- America's never been scared,

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:08.888
we can't be scared now.

00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:11.557
What you do is you fight
evil, wherever it exists,

00:08:11.557 --> 00:08:13.192
we need strength right now.

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:14.460
If he's gonna do something,

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.062
he's gonna do it regardless.

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:19.432
The best thing we can do
is continue to isolate.

00:08:19.432 --> 00:08:21.434
Isolate him in the
eyes of the world

00:08:21.434 --> 00:08:22.735
and continue to make sure that

00:08:22.735 --> 00:08:25.371 align:start size:88% position:13%
we have all of our
ally partners together.

00:08:25.371 --> 00:08:27.673
I mean, the thing that
bothers me the most is

00:08:27.673 --> 00:08:29.675
where are the Arab countries?

00:08:29.675 --> 00:08:31.477 align:start size:88% position:13%
They haven't said a word
through all of this.

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:32.979
This is an oil war.

00:08:32.979 --> 00:08:34.747
They should absolutely
be saying something.

00:08:34.747 --> 00:08:36.549
You know why they're
not saying anything?

00:08:36.549 --> 00:08:39.585 align:start size:88% position:13%
Is they don't trust
that America will lead.

00:08:39.585 --> 00:08:42.955
And they don't trust
that Putin will fail.

00:08:42.955 --> 00:08:45.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so the best thing
United States could do is

00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:49.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
step up and lead and kick
Putin where it hurts.

00:08:49.128 --> 00:08:50.763
Might he uses nukes?

00:08:50.763 --> 00:08:53.032
Yes, but the bigger question is

00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:56.035
Ukraine had nuclear production

00:08:56.035 --> 00:08:58.170 align:start size:84% position:16%
and there was a
treaty that was done

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.740
with US, Russia and Ukraine,

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.942
where Ukraine gave up
all of their nukes,

00:09:02.942 --> 00:09:06.312 align:start size:97% position:3%
they were the third largest
holder of nuclear arms,

00:09:06.312 --> 00:09:08.014
gave up all of their nukes

00:09:08.014 --> 00:09:11.817
in the name of being free, in
the name being independent.

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:15.721
What does this say to
countries like Iran?

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:17.189
North Korea?

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:18.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
Those that were saying
they have to denuclearize,

00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.860
why would they give
up their arms now?

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:23.129 align:start position:0%
When they know that they really
don't get the protections

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:24.463
they say they're gonna get.

00:09:24.463 --> 00:09:25.932
So what you're gonna see is

00:09:25.932 --> 00:09:28.134 align:start size:97% position:3%
