they need to really step up.

00:18:31.376 --> 00:18:32.444
- Did we do anything?

00:18:32.444 --> 00:18:33.979
Did we do anything at the UN,

00:18:33.979 --> 00:18:36.548
I mean, this was like a slow
motion war for three weeks

00:18:36.548 --> 00:18:38.250
where Biden kept saying,
oh, it's gonna happen.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.685
Maybe it'll happen
tomorrow three days.

00:18:39.685 --> 00:18:41.954
I mean, were we doing
anything at the UN?

00:18:41.954 --> 00:18:43.922
- Oh yes, absolutely.

00:18:43.922 --> 00:18:45.657
What America was doing at the UN

00:18:45.657 --> 00:18:49.628
was they got back into the
UN Human Rights Council,

00:18:49.628 --> 00:18:51.163
you know,

00:18:51.163 --> 00:18:52.397
and now they're sitting on
that Human Rights Council,

00:18:52.397 --> 00:18:54.800
shoulder with Russia and China,

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.002 align:start size:84% position:16%
who Russia's now
committing war crimes.

00:18:57.002 --> 00:18:58.637
So Biden neither needs to,

00:18:58.637 --> 00:19:00.739 align:start size:88% position:13%
to kick Russia out of
the Human Rights Council

00:19:00.739 --> 00:19:02.474
or he needs to get off himself.

00:19:02.474 --> 00:19:04.376
America was active at the UN,

00:19:04.376 --> 00:19:06.578
in dealing with this Iran deal.

00:19:06.578 --> 00:19:09.414
Can you imagine now that
you're gonna go in a room

00:19:09.414 --> 00:19:12.985
and negotiate with China
and Russia on, you know,

00:19:12.985 --> 00:19:15.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
how to stop Iran from
producing nuclear weapons?

00:19:15.854 --> 00:19:18.690
That's a joke and it would,
it's a fireable offense,

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:21.894 align:start size:97% position:3%
if Biden continues to try
and get into this Iran deal.

00:19:21.894 --> 00:19:23.729
And so, yeah, they
were doing things,

00:19:23.729 --> 00:19:25.531
but they were doing
all the wrong things.

00:19:25.531 --> 00:19:26.965 align:start size:84% position:16%
And what they should
have been doing

00:19:26.965 --> 00:19:28.000
was rallying the troops,

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.434
what they should have been doing

00:19:29.434 --> 00:19:32.171 align:start size:97% position:3%
was tough love to the
European saying, stop this.

00:19:32.171 --> 00:19:34.139
And you know, one of
the things I did was,

00:19:34.139 --> 00:19:38.277
I was constantly beating up
Germany for Nord Stream 2.

00:19:38.277 --> 00:19:40.913
And, you know, and we
were constantly saying

00:19:40.913 --> 00:19:42.447
this can't happen.

00:19:42.447 --> 00:19:45.817
That never should have been
allowed to happen this year.

00:19:45.817 --> 00:19:47.186 align:start size:84% position:16%
So there were a
lot of things done,

00:19:47.186 --> 00:19:48.887
it just were all
the wrong things.

00:19:50.055 --> 00:19:53.458
- So when they have a
resolution at the UN

00:19:53.458 --> 00:19:55.994
and one of the countries
that's doing the invading

00:19:55.994 --> 00:19:57.629
has veto power,

00:19:57.629 --> 00:19:59.131
is it all just theater?

00:19:59.131 --> 00:20:00.399
I mean, at the end, like,

00:20:00.399 --> 00:20:02.434
is it just sort of
ridiculous theater

00:20:02.434 --> 00:20:05.637
because Russia vetoed the
resolution about Russia.

00:20:05.637 --> 00:20:07.372 align:start size:84% position:16%
You can't blame
'em for doing that.

00:20:07.372 --> 00:20:08.941 align:start size:84% position:16%
- So the interesting
thing is yes,

00:20:08.941 --> 00:20:13.045 align:start size:97% position:3%
Russia vetoed the resolution
in the security council,

00:20:13.045 --> 00:20:14.546
but what they were able to do

00:20:14.546 --> 00:20:16.014 align:start size:84% position:16%
that Russia couldn't
do anything about

00:20:16.014 --> 00:20:18.317
was they took it to
the General Assembly,

00:20:18.317 --> 00:20:20.219
you know, the 193 countries.

00:20:20.219 --> 00:20:22.688
And what happened was, you know,

00:20:22.688 --> 00:20:25.290
basically the world
condemned Russia,

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.893 align:start size:97% position:3%
there were only five countries
on the side of Russia,

00:20:27.893 --> 00:20:30.829 align:start size:97% position:3%
Russia included, but Russia
stood there with Syria,

00:20:30.829 --> 00:20:31.663
North Korea.

00:20:31.663 --> 00:20:32.931
Those are not friends

00:20:32.931 --> 00:20:34.032
you wanna be sitting
on the corner with,

00:20:34.032 --> 00:20:35.500
and that's who they were.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.436
And so, yeah, they did that,

00:20:37.436 --> 00:20:38.403
but at the end of the day,

00:20:38.403 --> 00:20:39.605
what does a resolution do?

00:20:39.605 --> 00:20:40.806
Right?

00:20:40.806 --> 00:20:43.542 align:start size:88% position:13%
So yes, it's, you know,
you're condemning,

00:20:43.542 --> 00:20:46.011 align:start size:97% position:3%
you're telling Russia,
you're a bad, you gotta stop,

00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:47.512
but it's not doing anything.

00:20:47.512 --> 00:20:50.983
And so, you know, there
goes to my frustration

00:20:50.983 --> 00:20:52.517
with the United Nations is,

00:20:52.517 --> 00:20:54.920
you know, saying something
and acting that's great.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:55.887
Now what?

00:20:55.887 --> 00:20:57.856
you know, now we get to perform.

00:20:57.856 --> 00:21:01.159
- So what does a sane resolution

00:21:01.159 --> 00:21:03.095
of this situation
look like to you?

00:21:03.095 --> 00:21:04.630
I mean, is this something

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.932
that we're just gonna be sort
of slowly in for a long time?

00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:09.868
Is there something that
we can do to give Putin

00:21:09.868 --> 00:21:12.571
that off ramp so that he
doesn't have to escalate?

00:21:12.571 --> 00:21:15.907
What is an actual out
of this look like?

00:21:15.907 --> 00:21:17.743
- Well, I think look at
the environment, right?

00:21:17.743 --> 00:21:21.313 align:start size:88% position:13%
So you've got Ukrainians
taking to the streets

00:21:21.313 --> 00:21:22.681
to defend themselves.

00:21:22.681 --> 00:21:24.316
You've got Russians.

00:21:24.316 --> 00:21:27.686 align:start size:97% position:3%
It's pretty ironic that you've
got thousands of Russians

00:21:27.686 --> 00:21:31.456
taking to the streets of
Russia, protesting Putin,

00:21:31.456 --> 00:21:32.658
extremely courageous,

00:21:32.658 --> 00:21:34.126 align:start size:84% position:16%
because they know that
they'll be killed.

00:21:34.126 --> 00:21:37.195
They know that they'll
be jailed for doing that.

00:21:37.195 --> 00:21:38.730
You've got, you know,

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.267
the Europeans really stepping
up at a time to help Ukraine.

00:21:42.267 --> 00:21:43.802
I think that you're gonna see,

00:21:43.802 --> 00:21:47.873
Russia's gonna continue
to take Ukraine by force.

00:21:47.873 --> 00:21:51.410
I think they're gonna kind of
sit on the barrier for a while

00:21:52.644 --> 00:21:54.746
and try and see how much
progress they can make.

00:21:54.746 --> 00:21:56.481
But at the end of the day,

00:21:56.481 --> 00:21:58.684
Putin's gonna try and put
one of his own lackeys

00:21:58.684 --> 00:22:02.254
in government, you
know, in Ukraine,

00:22:02.254 --> 00:22:04.623
but the Ukrainian people,
aren't gonna go for that.

00:22:04.623 --> 00:22:06.124 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean, I think
you've seen the spirit

00:22:06.124 --> 00:22:07.059
of the Ukrainian people,

00:22:07.059 --> 00:22:08.927
They're not ever go for that.

00:22:08.927 --> 00:22:10.762
So Putin's gotta
figure this out.

00:22:10.762 --> 00:22:13.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, he's already
become a pry in the world.

00:22:13.098 --> 00:22:17.269
He's isolating himself, So
he's already very paranoid.

00:22:17.269 --> 00:22:19.938
I think he's worried about
being eliminated himself.

00:22:19.938 --> 00:22:23.008
We know that he's trying
to eliminate Zelenskyy.

00:22:23.008 --> 00:22:24.209
So, you know, I think

00:22:24.209 --> 00:22:26.712 align:start size:88% position:13%
this isn't gonna be done
in a couple of days.

00:22:26.712 --> 00:22:28.080
The sad part is,

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:29.781
the media is gonna
get tired of this.

00:22:29.781 --> 00:22:32.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
The media's not gonna have
constant Ukraine shots

00:22:32.517 --> 00:22:34.920
and everybody else is gonna
go back to their business,

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.722 align:start size:84% position:16%
but the bloodshed's
not gonna stop.

00:22:36.722 --> 00:22:39.157
And I think this is
gonna last a while.

00:22:39.157 --> 00:22:41.059 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Yeah, I'm glad you mentioned
the media part of this

00:22:41.059 --> 00:22:44.896
because I feel that it's my
job to just sort of translate

00:22:44.896 --> 00:22:46.631 align:start size:81% position:19%
some of this stuff
to my audience

00:22:46.631 --> 00:22:49.267
and bring on people like you,
who are the experts in this

00:22:49.267 --> 00:22:51.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
so that they can get an
honest assessment of this.

00:22:51.269 --> 00:22:53.338 align:start position:0%
One of the things that I'm
really struggling with right now

00:22:53.338 --> 00:22:55.073
is who to trust.

00:22:55.073 --> 00:22:58.443 align:start size:97% position:3%
You know, I've lost such
trust in our corporate press

00:22:58.443 --> 00:22:59.978
that, you know,

00:22:59.978 --> 00:23:01.546
it's very hard for me to
pick up the New York times

00:23:01.546 --> 00:23:04.082 align:start size:84% position:16%
that I feel lies
about so many things

00:23:04.082 --> 00:23:05.484
and say, oh,

00:23:05.484 --> 00:23:06.885 align:start size:97% position:3%
but this is the thing
they're telling the truth on.

00:23:06.885 --> 00:23:08.120
How do you, I mean,

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:10.455
is it just from talking
to a other ambassadors

00:23:10.455 --> 00:23:11.656 align:start size:84% position:16%
and talking to
people on the ground,

00:23:11.656 --> 00:23:13.992 align:start size:88% position:13%
how do you get news
that make sense to you?

00:23:13.992 --> 00:23:15.627
- I read a lot

00:23:15.627 --> 00:23:17.562
and I read a lot of
different sources

00:23:17.562 --> 00:23:18.964
and I do,

00:23:18.964 --> 00:23:22.901 align:start size:97% position:3%
I have been in conversations
with my counterpart

00:23:22.901 --> 00:23:24.503 align:start size:84% position:16%
at the United
Nations from Ukraine

00:23:24.503 --> 00:23:26.571
who's now back in Ukraine.

00:23:26.571 --> 00:23:28.273
You know, we're
talking to people

00:23:28.273 --> 00:23:30.142
who have families on
the ground in Russia.

00:23:30.142 --> 00:23:31.076
You know, you just,

00:23:31.076 --> 00:23:32.878
you read as much as you can

00:23:32.878 --> 00:23:35.013
and you take all the
opinions out of it.

00:23:35.013 --> 00:23:36.548
That's the key.

00:23:36.548 --> 00:23:39.217
You know, the media wants
to tell you what to think.

00:23:39.217 --> 00:23:40.986
You don't need to
know what to think.

00:23:40.986 --> 00:23:42.487
You need to know the facts.

00:23:42.487 --> 00:23:44.623
And then you put together
what you think on your own.

00:23:44.623 --> 00:23:46.925
And so, you know, you
can't read too much,

00:23:46.925 --> 00:23:50.162 align:start size:97% position:3%
but the media, at this
point, I will say the media,

00:23:50.162 --> 00:23:53.832 align:start size:97% position:3%
at least they're covering
Ukraine in what is a fair way.

00:23:53.832 --> 00:23:57.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're not trying to, you
know, rosy up on Putin.

00:23:57.669 --> 00:23:59.871
They're calling him
the thug that he is.

00:23:59.871 --> 00:24:01.740 align:start size:97% position:3%
They're showing the
bloodshed that's happening.

00:24:01.740 --> 00:24:03.675
They're highlighting Zelenskyy

00:24:03.675 --> 00:24:06.344
and the brave people of Ukraine.

00:24:06.344 --> 00:24:08.046
And I think that's
what we need to see,

00:24:08.046 --> 00:24:11.650 align:start size:97% position:3%
but you know, the media
hasn't been an outlet to trust

00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:13.351
for a very long time.

00:24:13.351 --> 00:24:16.588
- Do you think that if it was
the guy that you worked for,

00:24:16.588 --> 00:24:19.257
President Trump and this
was happening right now

00:24:19.257 --> 00:24:20.926
that the media would be
treating this the same?

00:24:20.926 --> 00:24:22.961 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean, it seems
fairly obvious to me

00:24:22.961 --> 00:24:24.396
that the media would be,

00:24:24.396 --> 00:24:27.399 align:start position:0%
everything would be at the
footsteps of America right now.

00:24:27.399 --> 00:24:28.867 align:start size:84% position:16%
And this is what
Trump brought upon us.

00:24:28.867 --> 00:24:30.902 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, you can actually
see them doing some of that,

00:24:30.902 --> 00:24:32.404
blaming Trump for this.

00:24:32.404 --> 00:24:34.473
Psaki, you know, you probably
saw that line the other day

00:24:34.473 --> 00:24:36.174 align:start size:88% position:13%
where she said,
there's a pattern here,

00:24:36.174 --> 00:24:39.010
of Putin invading Ukraine.

00:24:39.010 --> 00:24:40.812
She forgot that the thing
that broke the pattern

00:24:40.812 --> 00:24:42.347
was the four years under Trump.

00:24:43.648 --> 00:24:45.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
- You know, it's
interesting because I've,

00:24:45.350 --> 00:24:46.885
I've have always told everybody,

00:24:46.885 --> 00:24:50.121
you know, the four years
that President Trump had,

00:24:50.121 --> 00:24:52.457
he never got an ounce of peace

00:24:52.457 --> 00:24:56.361
or one bit of credit
through all four years.

00:24:56.361 --> 00:24:59.331 align:start size:84% position:16%
He was hammered
every day, all day.

00:24:59.331 --> 00:25:00.999
And he didn't have Afghanistan.

00:25:00.999 --> 00:25:02.601
He didn't have the Ukraine mess.

00:25:02.601 --> 00:25:05.070 align:start size:84% position:16%
He didn't have
inflation like this.

00:25:05.070 --> 00:25:06.872
He didn't have the
crime in the streets,

00:25:06.872 --> 00:25:07.939
he didn't have all that.

00:25:07.939 --> 00:25:09.774
And they still beat up on him.

00:25:09.774 --> 00:25:11.276
And then, you know,

00:25:11.276 --> 00:25:14.679 align:start size:97% position:3%
to go have them hail Biden's
State of the Union speech

00:25:14.679 --> 00:25:17.082
as this amazing unifier.

00:25:17.082 --> 00:25:18.650
You know, it wasn't that.

00:25:18.650 --> 00:25:21.987 align:start size:84% position:16%
All it was was a
lot of Republican
talking points saying,

00:25:21.987 --> 00:25:24.089 align:start size:97% position:3%
