rid of crime on the streets.

00:25:24.089 --> 00:25:25.891 align:start size:84% position:16%
We've gotta put
kids back in school.

00:25:25.891 --> 00:25:28.560 align:start size:84% position:16%
We have choose
freedom over tyranny.

00:25:28.560 --> 00:25:30.495
You know, we've got
to fund the police.

00:25:30.495 --> 00:25:31.696
Well, guess what?

00:25:31.696 --> 00:25:34.399 align:start size:84% position:16%
We've been saying
that this entire year

00:25:34.399 --> 00:25:35.734
that Biden's been in office

00:25:35.734 --> 00:25:37.269
and now he's saying it,

00:25:37.269 --> 00:25:40.839
but you, he didn't offer one
solution, not one solution.

00:25:40.839 --> 00:25:43.375
And you know, the
only solution Dave,

00:25:43.375 --> 00:25:46.011
is to win the races in 2022,

00:25:46.011 --> 00:25:47.512
we've gotta take back the House.

00:25:47.512 --> 00:25:49.014
We've gotta take
back the Senate.

00:25:49.014 --> 00:25:51.249
We've got 36 governors races.

00:25:51.249 --> 00:25:52.784
And if you ever saw

00:25:52.784 --> 00:25:55.287
the importance of a
governor, you know,

00:25:55.287 --> 00:25:57.322
you saw it during COVID

00:25:57.322 --> 00:26:00.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you saw some fantastic
Republican governors

00:26:00.058 --> 00:26:01.359
go and protect their people.

00:26:01.359 --> 00:26:03.595
And I think that we've
gotta really make sure

00:26:03.595 --> 00:26:07.666
that we put a stop to all of
this progressive extremism

00:26:07.666 --> 00:26:09.401 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
that we're seeing
come out of the Left

00:26:09.401 --> 00:26:12.003 line:0%
and, you know, stop
Biden and try and,

00:26:12.003 --> 00:26:13.805 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
you know, say a
prayer along the way,

00:26:13.805 --> 00:26:16.207 line:0%
because it's gonna be
a long three years.

00:26:16.207 --> 00:26:17.175
- Not only do I know it,

00:26:17.175 --> 00:26:18.643
but as you know, I'm living it

00:26:18.643 --> 00:26:21.413
because I am in the free
state of Florida right now,

00:26:21.413 --> 00:26:23.715
not at my home in Cali anymore.

00:26:23.715 --> 00:26:25.750 align:start size:84% position:16%
We only have a
couple minutes left,

00:26:25.750 --> 00:26:27.986
but let's just go with the,
the political part of this,

00:26:27.986 --> 00:26:28.820
for just a bit.

00:26:28.820 --> 00:26:30.055
Does it drive you crazy

00:26:30.055 --> 00:26:31.656 align:start size:84% position:16%
like when you watch
the State of the Union

00:26:31.656 --> 00:26:34.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Biden basically starts
