that Republicans, Conservatives,

00:26:36.294 --> 00:26:38.096
whatever have been
saying for years.

00:26:38.096 --> 00:26:39.431
Oh, now we have to
fund the police.

00:26:39.431 --> 00:26:41.232 align:start size:88% position:13%
We have to get kids back
in school, et cetera.

00:26:41.232 --> 00:26:43.168
Does it drive you nuts that,

00:26:43.168 --> 00:26:45.403 align:start size:84% position:16%
that they can always
get away with it?

00:26:45.403 --> 00:26:46.938
That's where I'm really
