00:26:46.938 --> 00:26:48.139 align:start size:84% position:16%
Like they're getting
away with it.

00:26:48.139 --> 00:26:49.774
And I think by October,

00:26:49.774 --> 00:26:51.076
they're gonna have
people believing

00:26:51.076 --> 00:26:53.511
that it was Republicans
who wanted lockdowns

00:26:53.511 --> 00:26:55.480 align:start size:84% position:16%
and Republicans
who wanted mandates

00:26:55.480 --> 00:26:57.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Republicans who wanted
to defund the police,

00:26:57.949 --> 00:26:59.217
et cetera, et cetera.

00:26:59.217 --> 00:27:01.620 align:start size:84% position:16%
- They're not gonna
get away with it Dave.

00:27:01.620 --> 00:27:02.921
- I hope you're right.

00:27:02.921 --> 00:27:05.190 align:start size:84% position:16%
- The American
public is too smart.

00:27:05.190 --> 00:27:06.891 align:start size:84% position:16%
The American people
are too smart.

00:27:06.891 --> 00:27:10.128 align:start size:97% position:3%
I was campaigning for
Glenn Youngkin in Virginia.

00:27:10.128 --> 00:27:12.564
I was campaigning for Jack
Ciattarelli in New Jersey.

00:27:12.564 --> 00:27:16.101
And we only lost that race
