00:27:18.069 --> 00:27:19.571
in Virginia was no different

00:27:19.571 --> 00:27:22.374
than the frustration on
the ground in New Jersey.

00:27:22.374 --> 00:27:24.376
And what you saw were,

00:27:24.376 --> 00:27:27.779
you saw Independents and
Conservative Democrats say

00:27:27.779 --> 00:27:29.114
we've had enough.

00:27:29.114 --> 00:27:30.615
They were tired of
what was happening

00:27:30.615 --> 00:27:32.283
to their kids in schools.

00:27:32.283 --> 00:27:34.619 align:start size:88% position:13%
They're tired of seeing
all these mandates.

00:27:34.619 --> 00:27:36.921
They were tired of seeing
the crime in their streets

00:27:36.921 --> 00:27:38.390
and they're each, you know,

00:27:38.390 --> 00:27:42.193 align:start size:97% position:3%
every family is paying more
than $250 more a month.

00:27:42.193 --> 00:27:43.428
That's a lot.

00:27:43.428 --> 00:27:45.664
So, no, I don't think
the American people

00:27:45.664 --> 00:27:46.598
will fall for this.

00:27:46.598 --> 00:27:47.799
And I think they'll show it

00:27:47.799 --> 00:27:50.068
when we come November in 2022

00:27:50.068 --> 00:27:52.604
and we win all these races back.

00:27:52.604 --> 00:27:55.006 align:start size:88% position:13%
- All right ambassador,
I only have--

00:27:55.006 --> 00:27:57.409 align:start size:97% position:3%
- That means we have to
prove we deserve to be there

00:27:57.409 --> 00:27:59.010
when we get there.

00:27:59.010 --> 00:28:00.478
- Yeah, well, absolutely.

00:28:00.478 --> 00:28:02.380 align:start size:84% position:16%
So I only have one
more question for you.

00:28:02.380 --> 00:28:04.616
It's the question you
definitely don't want,

00:28:04.616 --> 00:28:06.618
but because I'm on the
record as saying that

00:28:06.618 --> 00:28:10.021
I want DeSantis to
stay here in Florida,

00:28:10.021 --> 00:28:14.592
because I believe that those
governorships are so important.

00:28:14.592 --> 00:28:16.194 align:start size:84% position:16%
There is a
Presidential Election,

00:28:16.194 --> 00:28:17.162
after the other thing,

00:28:17.162 --> 00:28:18.797
I kind of asked y'all last time.

00:28:18.797 --> 00:28:20.265
I mean, how you feeling,

00:28:20.265 --> 00:28:22.901 align:start size:97% position:3%
obviously you're not thrilled
with worldwide leadership

00:28:22.901 --> 00:28:24.369
at the moment,

00:28:24.369 --> 00:28:26.104
and there's gonna be a
really wide ranging crop.

00:28:26.104 --> 00:28:27.305
Whoever is in it.

00:28:27.305 --> 00:28:29.040 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm excited for
the Republican crop

00:28:29.040 --> 00:28:31.910
because I do sense it's gonna
be a lot of new, fresh blood,

00:28:31.910 --> 00:28:34.345
and there'll be a sort of
wide variety of voices.

00:28:34.345 --> 00:28:36.548
Are you thinking
about it at all?

00:28:36.548 --> 00:28:38.583 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Well, I think
that there is no 24,

00:28:38.583 --> 00:28:40.218
if we don't win in 2022,

00:28:40.218 --> 00:28:42.921 align:start size:88% position:13%
but I don't think I
have to make a decision

00:28:42.921 --> 00:28:45.390
until the first part of 23.

00:28:45.390 --> 00:28:47.726
I can tell you, I've
never lost a race.

00:28:47.726 --> 00:28:49.494
I'm not gonna start now.

00:28:49.494 --> 00:28:51.730 align:start size:88% position:13%
So if there's a place
for me, then we'll move.

00:28:51.730 --> 00:28:53.131
If there's not,

00:28:53.131 --> 00:28:56.234 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm gonna fight for America
for as long as I can

00:28:56.234 --> 00:28:59.003
and make sure that we
do whatever we need to.

00:28:59.003 --> 00:29:00.672
The beauty of it is,

00:29:00.672 --> 00:29:02.941
